sentences.text:
Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER 1) Writ Petition is allowed;
2) Award Notice dated 17th December, 2020 (Annexure-C) issued by the respondent No.2 in respect of the property of the petitioners is hereby quashed, consequently the Award dated 25th September, 2020 (Annexure-F) is set-aside;
3) Respondent No.2-Special Land Acquisition Officer is directed to consider the case of the petitioners in terms of Section 29(2) of the KIAD Act upon the petitioners satisfying all the requirements thereof;
4) In the event of there being any adverse claim with regard to subject land belonging to the petitioners, prior to the disbursal of the amount, the Award Notice will be revived automatically;
NC: 2024:KHC:45664 WP NO.11465 OF 2023 5) Respondent No.2-Special Land Acquisition Officer is directed to withdraw the amount in deposit before the competent Court, if any, and disburse to the petitioners in terms of the observation made above in accordance with law.
SD/-
(E.S. INDIRESH) JUDGE ARK Smt. Lakshminarayanamma vs The State Of Karnataka on 12 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/48488169/
